@ComponentImpactArea
Scenario: To verify that after Patch request data should get update in DataBase                                                                                         # src/test/resources/features/componentimpactarea.feature:24
PATCH Request Body:
{
  "componentId": 3510,
  "impactAreaId": 1970
}
PATCH Response Body:
{"id":14,"componentId":3510,"deleted":false,"impactAreaId":1970}
Status Code: 200
  When Update Patch ComponentImpactArea                                                                                                                                 # Issue_persistence.ComponentsImpactArea.Update_patch_componentimpactarea()
  Then Validate API ES and DB for ComponentImpactAreaId after POST skipping ES false excludingEverywhere "null" excludeFromRequest "id,deleted" excludeFromEs "deleted" # Issue_persistence.ComponentsImpactArea.validate_api_es_db_for_ComponentImpactAreaId_dynamic(java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String)
  Then The ComponentImpactArea response status code should be 200                                                                                                       # Issue_persistence.ComponentsImpactArea.the_componentimpactarea_response_status_code_should_be(java.lang.Integer)

